  <h3>Labour Leadership into the Next Election</h3>
  <p>
    The Labour Party is currently lead by Keir Starmer, though he only has a 27%
    chance of remaining as the leader of the Labour party going into the next
    election.
  </p>
  <Manifold slug="Tetraspace/who-will-be-the-leader-of-the-labou-6i8kyac5xo" />
  <p>
    The leader of the Labour party does affect Labour's chances of winning the
    general election, on the order of 10% between the likely candidates:
  </p>

  <Manifold slug="Tetraspace/if-this-person-is-the-leader-of-the-8QNARsC6Oq" />

  <p>
    A summary table of these probabilities for the main contenders as of {
      lastUpdated.toDateString()
    } is below.
  </p>

